Key libraries & why
•	GSAP — best for reliable, buttery animations and sequencing.
•	Barba.js or Turbo (or Next.js app hooks) — for smooth page transitions (PJAX).
•	Three.js — for hero WebGL / shader-driven backgrounds (particles, morphing shapes).
•	Lottie (bodymovin) — for lightweight complex micro-animations (buttons, logos).
•	tsparticles — attractive particle systems, easier than raw three.js for particles.
•	Lenis (or locomotive) — silky scrolling and scroll smoothing.
•	Framer Motion — if using React/Next.js, terrific for declarative animations.
