6 — IndexedDB Versioning & Migration
•	Start with dbVersion = 1. In upgrades run db.createObjectStore() for each store.
•	Define a migration function for changes (add fields, rename stores). Keep migrations deterministic.
________________________________________
7 — Offline First UX Patterns
•	Read cache: On first load, fetch seed content (bundled JSON) and store to IndexedDB. App reads from DB always for content pages.
•	Write queue: Local writes (apply for job, submit assignment, post forum) are saved to IndexedDB and flagged in audit_logs as pendingSync:true.
•	Background Sync: If online, push pending items to sync endpoint (if no backend yet, simply mark synced). Later, replace with real server sync.
•	Optimistic UI: Assume write success -> update UI immediately; mark pending visually until confirmed.
•	Data export/import: Allow user to export DB subset (enrollments, certificates) as JSON for backup or auditor.
