________________________________________
1. Executive Summary (elevator pitch)
Cyber Elias Academy is a full-stack digital empowerment ecosystem that trains, certifies, mentors, and deploys digital talent while delivering affordable digital products and services to SMEs and institutions. The platform combines an LMS, Talent Agency, SME solutions marketplace, community features, CSR project management, and admin operations — all presented via a modern web and mobile-ready interface.
