2. Goals & Success Metrics
Business goals (12–36 months)
•	Train 5,000 learners and certify 2,000 within 12 months.
•	Place 60% of graduates into paid roles or paid projects within 6 months of graduation.
•	Acquire 50 SME clients in Year 1.
