ccount - POST /login - Authenticate user - POST /logout - Invalidate token - POST /refresh - Refresh access token - GET /me - Get current user - PATCH /profile - Update profile - POST /password - Change password - POST /forgot-password - Request reset - POST /reset-password - Reset with token - POST /verify-email - Verify email ### Users (/api/v1/users) - GET /:userId/profile - Get public profile - GET /me/profile - Get own profile - PATCH /profile - Update profile - GET /:userId/portfolio - Get portfolio - GET /portfolio - Get own portfolio - POST /portfolio - Add portfolio item - PATCH /portfolio/:id - Update item - DELETE /portfolio/:id - Delete item - POST /skills - Add skill - DELETE /skills/:id - Remove skill ### Courses (/api/v1/courses) - GET / - List courses (paginated, filtered) - GET /featured - Featured courses - GET /popular - Popular courses - GET /categories - Course categories - GET /:id - Get course - GET /slug/:slug - Get by slug - GET /:courseId/modules - Get modules - GET /:courseId/lessons/:lessonId - Get lesson - POST /:courseId/enroll - Enroll in course - GET /enrollments - User enrollments - POST /:courseId/lessons/:lessonId/complete - Mark complete - POST / - Create course (instructor) - PATCH /:id - Update course - DELETE /:id - Delete course ### Jobs (/api/v1/jobs) - GET / - List jobs (paginated, filtered) - GET /:id - Get job - POST / - Create job (client) - PATCH /:id - Update job (owner) - DELETE /:id - Delete job (owner) - POST /:jobId/apply - Apply to job - GET /applications - My applications - POST /applications/:id/withdraw - Withdraw - POST /:jobId/save - Save job - DELETE /:jobId/save - Unsave job - GET /saved - Saved jobs - GET /suggestions - Job suggestions ### Wallet (/api/v1/wallet) - GET / - Get wallet - GET /transactions - Transaction history - GET /transactions/:id - Single transaction - POST /withdraw - Request withdrawal - GET /withdrawals - Withdrawal history - POST /withdrawals/:id/cancel - Cancel pending - GET /payment