CYBER ELIAS ACADEMY – TRUE MVP REQUIREMENTS
🧱 LAYER 1: LEGAL, IDENTITY & TRUST (NON-NEGOTIABLE)
If these are missing, nothing else matters.
1. Legal & Business Identity
Minimum required:
•	CAC registration (done)
•	Official business name usage everywhere
•	Company bank account
•	TIN registered
•	Clear ownership & authority (Founder = Director)
Documents to have ready (even if not in-app):
•	CAC Certificate
•	MEMART
•	Bank confirmation
•	Simple Company Profile (2–3 pages)
•	Basic Terms & Privacy Policy (on website)
👉 MVP rule: You don’t need full compliance automation, but you must be credible.
________________________________________
🧠 LAYER 2: CORE VALUE DELIVERY (THE HEART OF MVP)
Your MVP must deliver one clear transformation:
“Beginner → Skilled → Proof → Opportunity”
So we cut everything else ruthlessly.
________________________________________
🎓 2A. Education (MINIMUM LMS)
What MUST exist
•	User registration/login
•	Student profile
•	Course catalog (even 2–3 courses is enough)
•	Course structure:
•	Modules
•	Lessons (video/text)
•	Progress tracking (completed/not completed)
•	One practical project per course
•	Certificate generation (simple PDF)
What can WAIT
•	Advanced quizzes
•	Ratings & reviews
•	AI grading
•	Offline sync
•	Gamification
👉 MVP principle:
Teach → Track → Certify
Nothing more.
________________________________________
💼 2B. Proof of Skill (ABSOLUTELY REQUIRED)
If students finish learning but have no proof, MVP fails.
Minimum:
•	Portfolio section (projects + description)
•	Skill list (manual input is fine)
