________________________________________
💳 3A. Payments (MINIMUM)
Required:
•	Course payment
•	One payment gateway (Paystack ONLY for now)
•	Transaction record per user
•	Admin view of payments
Can wait:
•	Wallets
•	Withdrawals
•	Multi-currency
•	Escrow
•	Stripe
👉 MVP payment rule:
Collect money → Record it → Don’t lose it.
________________________________________
🧑‍💼 LAYER 4: JOB & OPPORTUNITY PIPELINE (DIFFERENTIATOR)
This is what separates Cyber Elias Academy from generic training platforms.
________________________________________
🧩 4A. Opportunity Matching (MINIMUM)
You do not need a full job marketplace yet.
Minimum viable version:
•	“Opportunities Board”
•	Admin can post:
•	Internships
•	Gigs
•	Practice projects
•	Students can:
•	Apply
•	Get assigned manually by admin
👉 Manual matching is fine at MVP.
Automation comes later.
________________________________________
🛠 LAYER 5: INTERNAL OPERATIONS (RUNNING WITHOUT CHAOS)
This is where most startups fail.
________________________________________
🧭 5A. Admin Panel (CRITICAL)
Must exist:
•	View users
•	View enrollments
•	View payments
•	Approve certificates
•	Post opportunities
•	Assign students to tasks
Nice to have later:
•	Full ERP
•	Analytics dashboards
•	HR tools
👉 MVP admin rule:
If the founder cannot see and control everything from one place → MVP is broken.
________________________________________
🧑‍🏫 LAYER 6: TEAM & DELIVERY (SMALL BUT FUNCTIONAL)
You want minimum staff with maximum leverage.
________________________________________
👥 MVP Team Roles (REALISTIC)
You only need:
1.	Founder (You)
•	Product
•	Teaching
•	Oversight
2.	One Instructor/Mentor (part-time)
3.	One Ops/Admin (can be intern)
4.	Students as:
•	Testers
•	Assistants
•	Junior implementers
👉 The system must allow humans to cover gaps, not automation.
________________________________________
🌍 LAYER 7: USER ACQUISITION & VISIBILITY
An MVP that nobody sees is dead.
________________________________________
📢 7A. Visibility Stack (MINIMUM)
Required:
•	Landing page
•	Clear value proposition
•	WhatsApp contact
•	Email contact
•	Social proof (even pilot photos)
•	YouTube channel (authority building)
Can wait:
•	Paid ads
•	Full SEO
•	Influencer partnerships
👉 MVP growth is manual hustle + credibility, not scale yet.
