🔐 LAYER 8: BASIC SECURITY & STABILITY
Do NOT over-engineer, but don’t be reckless.
Minimum:
•	Password hashing
•	Role separation (student/admin)
•	Input validation
•	Rate limiting on login
•	Secure hosting
Can wait:
•	Pen testing
•	Advanced RBAC
•	Auditing
________________________________________
📦 LAYER 9: WHAT IS DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED FROM MVP
These are NOT MVP, even if they sound sexy:
❌ Full ERP
❌ Full marketplace automation
❌ Advanced analytics
❌ AI tutors
❌ Blockchain certificates
❌ Mobile apps
❌ Franchising
❌ International payments
❌ Complex wallet systems
