•	LMS (basic)
•	Projects & proof
•	Payment collection
•	Admin control
•	Opportunity pipeline
•	Manual operations
•	Visibility channels
MVP SHOULD NOT HAVE
•	Fancy automation
•	Overbuilt workflows
•	Feature bloat
•	Scale assumptions
