🎯 MVP SUCCESS CRITERIA (THIS IS THE TEST)
Your MVP is successful if:
•	10–30 students complete a course
•	At least 5 build real projects
•	At least 2 get paid opportunities
•	You collect money without issues
•	You can run it with ≤3 core people
•	You learn what breaks first
